Negative control for the Results count after a FAILED collection read.

Drops the guard, so the display row reports the last GOOD read's
`pagination.total` as the collection's size while the current read failed and
nothing is drawn — which is what the forced `error-collection` preset put on
screen: `showing 0 of 3` over a table holding no rows.

Apply from the repo root: `git apply <this file>`; revert with `git apply -R`.

Reds: the list-surface count spec — a collection whose own read failed reports
what is drawn and no denominator.

